(A12341/)                      /bwipp.HIBCbadSecondary er_tmpl
(A12341/X1)                    /bwipp.HIBCbadSecondary er_tmpl

% Link character may be any character

($$7AB/) ok_tmpl
($$7AB ) ok_tmpl

